      "content": "wait really?? i feel like im just being dramatic lol. the itching is the main thing and the tightness is like... just a little weird, not like i cant breathe or anything. i have a whole bottle of benadryl here and i also have some prednisone left over from a different thing last year. wouldn't taking a couple of those just clear it up faster so i dont have to deal with the ER?",
